---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
    title="Digital Tools — Less."
    description="Discover practical digital minimalism tools: dumbphones and focus apps that help you reduce screen time."
    path="/tech/tools"
    section="tech"
>
        <section class="hero small">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <h1>Tools</h1>
                <p class="subtitle">The right tools make less feel like more.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-shapes">
                <div class="shape shape-1"></div>
                <div class="shape shape-2"></div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="content-section">
            <h2>Dumbphones</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">The most powerful way to reduce screen time is to carry a phone that doesn't demand your attention.</p>
            <div class="cards">
                <a href="https://www.thelightphone.com/" class="card" data-tilt target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <h3>Light Phone</h3>
                    <p>A beautifully minimal phone designed to be used as little as possible. Calls, texts, and a few essential tools — nothing more.</p>
                    <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
                </a>
                <a href="https://www.mudita.com/products/phones/mudita-pure/" class="card" data-tilt target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <h3>Mudita Pure</h3>
                    <p>An ultraminimal phone with an E Ink display, built for calm and focus. Calls, texts, and an alarm — distraction-free by design.</p>
                    <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
                </a>
                <a href="https://www.punkt.ch/en/products/mp02-4g-mobile-phone/" class="card" data-tilt target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <h3>Punkt MP02</h3>
                    <p>A Swiss-designed 4G feature phone for people who want to talk and text without the constant pull of apps and notifications.</p>
                    <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
                </a>
                <a href="https://techless.com/" class="card" data-tilt target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <h3>WisePhone</h3>
                    <p>A smartphone stripped of social media, ads, and browsers. Designed for families and individuals seeking freedom from digital noise.</p>
                    <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
                </a>
                <a href="https://mudita.com/products/phones/mudita-kompakt/" class="card" data-tilt target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <h3>Mudita Kompakt</h3>
                    <p>A minimalist E Ink phone designed for focus, privacy, and freedom from digital distractions.</p>
                    <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
                </a>
                <a href="https://gabb.com/gabb-phone/" class="card" data-tilt target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <h3>Gabb Phone</h3>
                    <p>A safe phone for kids and teens with no internet, no social media, and GPS tracking.</p>
                    <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="content-section">
            <h2>Focus Tools</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">Not ready for a dumbphone? These apps block distractions on the devices you already have.</p>
            <div class="cards">
                <a href="https://shiftyourphone.com/?ref=SUSRQKSJ" class="card" data-tilt target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <h3>SHIFT</h3>
                    <p>A guided approach to turning your smartphone into a calmer, distraction-reduced device with intentional tools.</p>
                    <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
                </a>
                <a href="https://undistracted.app/" class="card" data-tilt target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <h3>UnDistracted</h3>
                    <p>A browser extension that removes distracting features like feeds, recommendations, and autoplay from popular websites.</p>
                    <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
                </a>
                <a href="https://selfcontrolapp.com/" class="card" data-tilt target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <h3>SelfControl</h3>
                    <p>A free Mac app that lets you block your own access to distracting websites for a set amount of time. Once started, it cannot be undone.</p>
                    <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
                </a>
                <a href="https://freedom.to/" class="card" data-tilt target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <h3>Freedom</h3>
                    <p>Block distracting websites and apps on all your devices. Schedule block sessions to enforce deep work times.</p>
                    <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
                </a>
                <a href="https://getcoldturkey.com/" class="card" data-tilt target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <h3>Cold Turkey</h3>
                    <p>The toughest website blocker for your computer. Lock yourself out of distractions until your work is done.</p>
                    <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
                </a>
                <a href="https://password-locker.com/referrals/signup/8ae8c11c/" class="card" data-tilt target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <h3>Password Locker</h3>
                    <p>A tool for locking your iPhone screen time settings, helping you enforce limits and reduce digital distractions.</p>
                    <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="content-section next-step">
            <h2>Tools Are Just the Start</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">Lasting change comes from daily practice. Build habits that keep you intentional.</p>
            <div class="next-step-links">
                <a href="/tech/habits" class="cta-button">Build Daily Habits</a>
            </div>
        </section>
</Layout>
